      </section>

      <section id="house" class="story-section" aria-labelledby="house-title">
        <h2 id="house-title">The 1938 house types</h2>
        <p><em>American Builder</em> showed three models used in the Westminster Ridge build-out: The Lee, The Westminster, and The Greenfield. The magazine reported prices from $5,800 to $8,500 and said 41 homes were built or under construction by September 1938.</p>
