      <section id="lake" class="story-section" aria-labelledby="lake-title">
        <h2 id="lake-title">The lake club</h2>
        <p>The pond appears inside the neighborhood on the 1939 plot plan and the 1940 county aerial. The 1939 article says a community lake club was purchasing the lake from the original subdividers. Members paid $2 per month for equipment, beach sand, and a lifeguard's salary. Admission fees also helped pay for the purchase.</p>
