      <section class="story-section" aria-labelledby="people-title">
        <h2 id="people-title">People connected to the neighborhood</h2>
        <p>The first sources name developers, builders, architects, and lake-club organizers. Later records also identify residents. A 2009 New York State Senate resolution says Stephen Holden III was raised in Westminster Ridge. It describes his later work as a White Plains attorney and civic leader.</p>
